{"repositoryId":1340049380,"availability":"available","full":"thebanri/limoni-voice","name":"limoni-voice","description":"Terminal-native voice chat & screen sharing. A P2P, end-to-end encrypted Discord-style alternative: Opus audio with echo cancellation and RNNoise, screen share up to 1080p/120 FPS with system audio, no accounts. One pure-Go binary for Linux, macOS and Windows, built with the Limoni TUI engine.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":17,"forks":1,"created":"2026-08-19T21:45:48Z","updated":"2026-10-16T19:20:30Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://limoni-voice-website.vercel.app/","topics":["cli","discord-alternative","e2ee","echo-cancellation","end-to-end-encryption","go","golang","limoni","nat-traversal","opus","p2p","peer-to-peer","rnnoise","screen-sharing","self-hosted","terminal","tui","voice-chat","voip","webrtc-alternative"],"demo":"https://limoni-voice-website.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:23.218Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:23.218Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:23.218Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T03:00:23.218Z","stars":17,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Terminal-Native • End-to-End Encrypted • P2P Voice Chat & Screen Sharing","A pure-Go (no cgo), single-binary, real-time P2P voice chat application running entirely inside your terminal."],"features":["Opus 48 kHz: CBR with in-band FEC; FEC redundancy follows the receivers' packet loss, and the bitrate steps between 12 and 32 kbps with the worst link in the room (drops quickly on loss or high latency, climbs back…","Adaptive Jitter Buffer: RFC 3550 jitter estimation, packet-loss concealment and FEC recovery","Echo Cancellation (AEC): Pure-Go Speex MDF port — use speakers without headphones","Noise & Click Suppression: Multi-band filter or pure-Go RNNoise (OFF / Standard / High / AI) plus a look-ahead transient suppressor for keyboard c